Cell["\<\
Category 1 is the only column that says anything about the device by \
thresholding its click data against a fixed boundary. Category 2 checks that \
the engine's own arithmetic is right before any device is sampled. Category 3 \
states, honestly, where the method provably cannot succeed no matter what \
data arrives \[LongDash] G7 reads a white-box declaration, and the detection \
efficiency \[Eta]* = 2/Sqrt[5] is a hard floor below which statistics alone \
can never close the loophole. Category 4 does not add a new threshold at all; \
it re-engineers what gets measured. Keep this four-way split in view: several \
later stages are really about moving a question from one column to another.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"86406f73-c7e8-b448-ba29-7ed54dc89b5e"],

Cell["\<\
The three-tier boundary every Category-1 check is calibrated against:\
\>", "CodeText",ExpressionUUID->"04f8cb98-991f-594e-b0b9-fa4dd066f019"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["\<\
Module[{y0 = 0, a = 2, th = N[Sqrt[5]], as = 2.5},
 Graphics[{
   {GrayLevel[0.75], Thickness[0.004], Line[{{1.9, y0}, {2.62, y0}}]},
   {RGBColor[0.20, 0.45, 0.85, 0.22], Rectangle[{a, -0.05}, {th, 0.05}]},
   {RGBColor[0.85, 0.45, 0.20, 0.22], Rectangle[{th, -0.05}, {as, 0.05}]},
   {GrayLevel[0.35], PointSize[0.018], Point[{a, y0}], Point[{th, y0}], \
Point[{as, y0}]},
   Text[Style[\"\[Alpha] = 2\", 12], {a, 0.15}],
   Text[Style[\"classical / NCHV\", 8, GrayLevel[0.5]], {a, -0.15}],
   Text[Style[\"\[Theta] = \[Sqrt]5 \[TildeEqual] 2.236\", 12, RGBColor[0.20, \
0.45, 0.85]], {th, 0.15}],
   Text[Style[\"quantum (Tsirelson analogue)\", 8, GrayLevel[0.5]], {th, \
-0.15}],
   Text[Style[\"\[Alpha]* = 5/2\", 12, RGBColor[0.85, 0.45, 0.20]], {as, \
0.15}],
   Text[Style[\"exclusivity ceiling (no-signaling)\", 8, GrayLevel[0.5]], \
{as, -0.15}],
   Text[Style[\"quantum zone\", 9, RGBColor[0.20, 0.45, 0.85]], {(a + th)/2, \
0.30}],
   Text[Style[\"'meta-optics' overhang\", 9, RGBColor[0.85, 0.45, 0.20]], \
{(th + as)/2, 0.30}]
   }, ImageSize -> 580, PlotRange -> {{1.8, 2.72}, {-0.28, 0.42}}, \
AspectRatio -> 0.30]]\
\>", "Input",
 CellOpen->False,
 CellLabel->
  "In[736]:=",ExpressionUUID->"9e97690d-9834-7246-b858-f069cd0c9892"],

