}, Open  ]],

Cell["\<\
The absolute gap \[Theta]-\[Alpha] grows slowly with n, but so does that \
ratio: proportionally, quantum sits closest to classical, and farthest from \
the supra-quantum ceiling, right at the pentagon. Five measurements is where \
the effect is cleanest to isolate, not where it is largest \[LongDash] which \
is exactly what you want in an atom. The same five directions also have a \
geometric picture worth making explorable: each measurement is a ray on a \
cone around a fixed axis, and exclusivity is precisely the statement that \
neighbouring rays are perpendicular.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"21706d22-706c-3e44-9fbc-003e83ceeda6"],

Cell["\<\
Exclusivity as geometry \[LongDash] drag the cone's half-angle away from its \
one correct value and watch it break:\
\>", "CodeText",ExpressionUUID->"bce3f2a0-9a2d-4342-8667-c7a27aa885c7"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Manipulate[\n Module[{vv, dots, navy = RGBColor[0.16, 0.28, 0.46], amber = RGBColor[0.80, 0.50, 0.18],\n    teal = RGBColor[0.24, 0.55, 0.50]},\n  vv = Table[{Sin[th] Cos[4 Pi j/5], Sin[th] Sin[4 Pi j/5], Cos[th]}, {j, 0, 4}];\n  dots = Table[vv[[j]] . vv[[Mod[j, 5] + 1]], {j, 1, 5}];\n  Row[{\n    Graphics3D[{\n      {Opacity[0.14], teal, Cone[{{0, 0, -0.05}, {0, 0, 1.15}}, 1.15 Tan[th]]},\n      {amber, Thick, Arrow[{{0, 0, 0}, {0, 0, 1.3}}]},\n      Table[{navy, Arrow[{{0, 0, 0}, vv[[j]]}], GrayLevel[0.2],\n         Text[Style[Subscript[\"v\", j - 1], FontFamily -> \"Helvetica\", 11], 1.18 vv[[j]]]}, {j, 1, 5}],\n      {Darker[teal, 0.3], Thick, Table[Line[{vv[[j]], vv[[Mod[j, 5] + 1]]}], {j, 1, 5}]}\n      }, Boxed -> False, ImageSize -> 300, PlotRange -> 1.5, SphericalRegion -> True],\n    BarChart[dots, PlotRange -> {-0.35, 1}, ChartStyle -> navy,\n     ImageSize -> 260, ImagePadding -> {{32, 10}, {24, 28}},\n     LabelStyle -> Directive[FontFamily -> \"Helvetica\", 10, GrayLevel[0.3]],\n     PlotLabel -> Style[\"adjacent dot products (0 = perpendicular)\", FontFamily -> \"Helvetica\", 10, GrayLevel[0.25]],\n     GridLines -> {None, {0}}, GridLinesStyle -> Directive[amber, Dashed, AbsoluteThickness[1]]]\n    }, Spacer[14]]],\n {{th, N[ArcCos[Sqrt[Cos[Pi/5]/(1 + Cos[Pi/5])]]], \"cone half-angle\"}, 0.4, 1.3, Appearance -> \"Labeled\"},\n ControlPlacement -> Bottom]", "Input", CellOpen -> False, CellLabel -> "In[740]:=", ExpressionUUID -> "eb76fb26-1a45-45ee-8283-bfff325354e2"],

