  "Out[792]=",ExpressionUUID->"cc74e0f5-772b-f74e-9606-efe8fbd4fb84"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell["\<\
The same nine meshes, the same correlation coordinate; only the choice of how \
to summarize the geometric-lens evolution differs, and the trend reverses. \
There is no monotone map from one lens's evolution to the other's, so the \
square does not commute \[LongDash] which is the point. The ruliological \
deliverable here is not a commuting diagram but the vivid failure of one, and \
it dramatizes a headline result rather than decorating it. That is also the \
boundary of the method: multiway and cellular-automaton pictures are faithful \
for the symbolic layer \[LongDash] the words, the shift, the certificate \
graphs, the clique search \[LongDash] and illustrative only for the \
continuous layer, where cos \[Theta] = 1/\[Phi], \[Sqrt]5, and the DLA closure \
come from linear algebra and graph invariants, not from any rewrite rule. \
Bookkeeping, kept in its place.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"4b103d16-81f2-124a-84cc-1c26b92f9e58"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Stage 9 \[LongDash] From Best Necklace to Physical Resource", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"b9c61607-c3fa-8740-ba0b-de04f912f03d"],

Cell["\<\
Since 'cct forever' is the best blueprint, the next step is to build it as a \
real entangled quantum resource: a cluster state, the kind of resource used \
in measurement-based quantum computing, and then verify its structure holds \
up even at millions of components. The connectivity is the glued-mesh graph \
itself, now read as a pattern of controlled-Z entangling bonds.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"5d2a2238-edb7-3446-822a-b2b4a2d8ba5a"],

Cell["The cct cluster state as a CZ-entangled pentagon chain:", "CodeText",ExpressionUUID->"050bafcf-a5f5-a648-af1d-0d1b12e504fc"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["\<\
wordRing = Function[{word, reps}, Module[{w = Characters[StringRepeat[word, \
reps]], L, edges = {}, u, v, km},
   L = Length[w];
   Do[km = Mod[k - 1, L];
     {u, v} = If[w[[km + 1]] === \"c\", {3 km + 1, 3 km + 2}, {3 km + 2, 3 km \
+ 1}];
     edges = Join[edges, {{u, v}, {u, 3 k + 1}, {3 k + 1, 3 k + 2}, {3 k + 2, \
3 k + 3}, {3 k + 3, v}}],
     {k, 0, L - 1}];
   Graph[Range[3 L], UndirectedEdge @@@ DeleteDuplicates[Sort /@ edges]]]];
Graph[wordRing[\"cct\", 4], VertexSize -> 0.6, VertexStyle -> RGBColor[.2, \
.45, .85],
 EdgeStyle -> GrayLevel[0.6], GraphLayout -> \"SpringElectricalEmbedding\", \
ImageSize -> 430,
 PlotLabel -> \"cct cluster connectivity (CZ bonds), (cct) repeated four \
times\"]\
\>", "Input",
 CellOpen->False,
 CellLabel->
  "In[793]:=",ExpressionUUID->"a523e826-e4f6-f84e-b2e7-fbcafd2807ee"],

